{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The argument-capture and uninitialized-property fixes are correct, and the blocking rule is now explicit. One iterator blocker remains: row 54 says duplication does not carry iterator tracking, but Zend duplicates iterator positions so a loop can follow a separated copy without restarting. I’m also checking the new call-validation and readonly-clone rules for contradictions."}}
